Package: @PKG@
Version: @VER@-1
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: duanyll <duanyll@outlook.com>
Depends: dkms (>= 3.1.8), firmware-nvidia-gsp (>= @VER@), g++
Provides: nvidia-kernel-@VER@, nvidia-kernel-open-dkms (= @VER@-1)
Conflicts: nvidia-kernel-open-dkms, nvidia-kernel-dkms
Replaces: nvidia-kernel-open-dkms
Description: NVIDIA open GPU kernel modules with PCIe P2P + 48G-4090 support (DKMS)
 Drop-in replacement for the CUDA-repo nvidia-kernel-open-dkms, built from a community
 fork of open-gpu-kernel-modules: peer-to-peer over PCIe plus a dynamic-BAR1 path for
 48GB-modded RTX 4090. The patched source is vendored, so DKMS builds it fully offline.
 Unofficial; not affiliated with NVIDIA.
